      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1314363774,
      "text": "Agave potatorum, the Verschaffelt agave, is a species of flowering plant in the family Asparagaceae. A smallish and attractive succulent perennial, it is native to partial desert areas of Mexico from Puebla south to Oaxaca."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Agave potatorum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agave_potatorum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 166868555,
      "text": "Agave potatorum es una especie de planta fanerógama. pequeña y atractiva perteneciente a la familia Agavaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Agave potatorum",
